            "Here is what happened:",
            "→ The launch team reported strong early usage\n→ The BA checked completed journeys, not just opens\n→ Many users stopped at the new confirmation step\n→ Support calls about the step began to grow\n→ The team fixed the step wording and layout",
            "The stakeholder said:\n\"Usage is up, so the update must be working.\"",
            "So the BA showed the gap between opens and completed payments, the team fixed the confusing step, and completions rose without any new promotion.",
            "Why?",
