            "Workaround: officers call the back office for the status, which takes time and interrupts other work. Options: receive the status report for that payment type, at a cost to be estimated by the technology team, or keep the manual check and accept the handling time. The assessment recommends the first option, because the manual check cost grows with volume."
        ],
        keyPoints: [
