    /// The no-endorsement note shown with certification names.
    static let certificationNote = "Career guidance written originally for Payments Training Hub. Certification names are used to identify the certifications only. This material is not affiliated with, sponsored, or endorsed by IIBA, Scrum.org, or PMI."
